WEBVTT

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:34.270
Yeah.

00:02:05.724 --> 00:02:06.724
I'm fine!

00:03:18.012 --> 00:03:18.512
Get out!

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.360
Thank you very much!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:07.390
I was in trouble because I came to a strange place.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.750
Where is this place?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.600
I don't know.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.890
Are you here too?

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.820
What is this place?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.590
Is it a castle?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:43.400
It was not midsummer

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.380
I'm in the way

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.580
I'm not going!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:48.610
What?

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.810
I'm busy looking for people

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.250
I'm the same

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.940
It's a coincidence

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:57.300
Then let's do our best

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:20.050
You can eat more if you want

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:32.020
What?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:39.500
Who are you?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:52.100
I don't know who it is, but I can't believe I'm attacking such a harmless creature.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.840
Spreading Change!

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:09.220
Softly spreading gentle light!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.640
Cure Prism!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.130
Precure Tropical Change!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:24.340
Innocent Cure Love!

00:07:31.212 --> 00:07:33.212
Prick-a-doodle-do!

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.240
Eek!

00:07:34.924 --> 00:07:35.944
RIKKI RI-

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.300
I wonder if they are both pre-cure?

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.380
I didn't know that there was a pre-cure other than my friends.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.730
I'm surprised that there is a bird that can be a human.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.640
I have a friend who lives here, but...

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:05.840
But, where exactly is this place?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.030
I don't know at all.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.250
It's neither a magical world nor a non-magical world.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.400
Speaking of something that looks familiar...

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.400
It's that castle, isn't it?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.790
If it's a castle, someone must be living there.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:22.130
Please wake up, princess!

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.810
It's over there!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.420
Grrrr!

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:06.660
Thank you for watching!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.940
But I'm happy!

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:44.350
If you think so, it means you're getting closer to the real princess!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:47.640
The real one?

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:50.920
I'm aiming for the real princess!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:57.200
Stop it!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.240
It means everyone is a pre-cure.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.600
I get it now.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.550
That being said,

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.780
there's no reason for everyone to act, right?

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:08.880
I don't know what kind of world this is,

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.320
but it's dangerous to act alone!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:11.720
Yeah!

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.330
It's more efficient to work together!

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.170
We're not in the same boat.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.660
I'm happy being alone.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.020
Well, well.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.570
Yukari-chan is older than you,

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.260
so be nice to younger kids.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.080
I don't want you to treat me like a child.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.770
On my planet, adults are already...

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:29.890
Thank you for watching!

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:35.290
You can do whatever you want. I'll do the same.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:36.370
Yukari!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:41.400
Are you sure you're okay?

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:45.730
I guess we'll have to wait for a while.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:56.240
And then suddenly the desert...

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.600
It's hot...

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:00.560
Are you okay?

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:05.160
Puka?

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.910
I said Puka!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.760
Hey, stop!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:14.680
You don't like being touched, do you?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.210
You're looking for a friend, aren't you?

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:44.610
Yeah.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.150
They call me Labyrin, but...

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:49.250
I got separated from them in a world I don't know.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:53.900
I'm worried about you, Labyrin.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.840
Everyone is in the same situation.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.240
Are you the same?

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.260
By the way, what are you going to do with this girl?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.500
I can't just leave her like that.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.880
I'm taking her on a trip.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.920
Then, shall we go together?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.010
I'm not gonna let you get away with this!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:20.220
I can't believe it

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:27.720
What's the situation?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:29.140
Huh?

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:37.420
If we're here, it means that my friends and I have a high possibility of being in this world, right?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.640
That's right.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:42.740
Then we have to find it quickly and find a way to return to the original world!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:48.570
I want to protect our world as a hero!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:53.140
To do that, we have to go to that castle quickly and find a clue!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:59.490
I'm going to do the most important thing right now!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:04.110
If you're hungry, you won't be energetic.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.940
If you're not energetic, you won't be able to walk.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.710
That's why I'm going to do my best to make you hungry right now!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:16.810
I'm also worried about everyone in the Tropical Club.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.560
But I was able to meet everyone like this.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.240
Grandma said it.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.140
It's a miso to combine the power of people and soup stock.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.370
So I'm sure it'll be okay.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.960
That's right. I'm sorry, I was a little impatient.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:01.300
Thank you.

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:14.810
I'm fine, but...

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.080
What? What? All of a sudden?

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:38.610
Then, when I realized, I was alone in this world.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.930
I can't remember how and when I came here.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.690
Me too.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:48.120
The common point is that it's a pre-cure.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.090
And...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.510
Those monsters...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.670
They seemed to know about the pre-cure.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.720
Maybe...

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:04.710
There might be bad people in this world, and there might be a Precure who will fight them.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:09.130
Then, what about that castle...

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:13.620
And the one who is involved in that one...

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:19.460
Ah... Ah... Oh...

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:27.470
No, it wasn't like that...

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:39.150
You're a pre-cure, why don't you remember?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:44.870
I'm sorry

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:48.040
That's right, I'm also a pre-cure

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:55.760
Preem

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:00.980
It's fine if it's Primm.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:04.900
Let's go!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.300
Yukari...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.930
Yukari...

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:28.440
Yukari...

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:47.010
Oh, you're safe.

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.380
Latte found you.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:54.820
Let's go.

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.970
I found something good nearby.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:21.100
Enlun, if I hadn't prioritized my own thoughts and thought about Yukari's feelings...

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.300
That's right.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.400
But, thank you.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:34.310
Everyone must have become lost in a world they don't know, and their hearts must have been tired.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.640
Well then, let's pour some hot water and get back together!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:44.900
It's a greeting from the stars of Arun.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:54.510
It's interesting.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:59.600
Even so...

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.690
It's convenient to have a foot bath in a place like this.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:05.970
This place is similar to the foot bath I know.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.770
It's a strange coincidence.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:12.000
It's beautiful.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:21.420
What's wrong? Yukari-chan?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:31.620
What's that?

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:36.660
If we can get on the train, we might be able to get to the nearby castle.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:42.590
There's a lot of stuff here!

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:44.460
Oh, I think I can use this!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.590
I found a lot of things here too!

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:50.570
Alright, then tonight we'll have onage!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:58.820
We've learned a lot about the ingredients of this world!

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:05.320
Don't you think we've been eating for a long time?

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:06.380
You can say that!

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:12.980
Well...

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:16.480
I turned my head, but it turned into a mess!

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:19.010
I transformed into Precure and did it!

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:20.390
I did it!

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:21.650
To Precure?

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:25.890
Please do it for me too!

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:26.530
Me too!

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:27.580
Of course!

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:31.740
Thank you very much!

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:39.360
I've met you before, haven't I?

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:39.840
What?

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:46.840
Can I ask you something?

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:47.540
Yes

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:50.410
What is Precure?

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.280
Precure?

00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:58.260
If you ask me again,

00:22:58.840 --> 00:22:59.980
Precure is...

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:00.620
What is it?

00:23:00.860 --> 00:23:03.400
By the way, Brim is also a Precure, right?

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:08.450
Ah, in other words, how did you become a Precure?

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:14.370
I think it's because I think this is the most important thing right now.

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:19.150
I want to save Recipipi from Bundledan.

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:21.420
What about you?

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:25.540
I originally wanted to be a hero.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:27.760
Hero?

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:28.360
Yes.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.420
Since long time ago, I've been carrying a notebook with me that I drew the hero's heart.

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:39.790
I've been writing it every day.

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:43.000
I'm often taught by my precious friends and friends.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:55.250
I'll do my best so that we can show them a good place.

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.240
Because...

00:23:58.460 --> 00:23:59.980
I can't take it anymore

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:00.330
Right?

00:24:00.570 --> 00:24:16.250
I don't need it.

00:24:16.310 --> 00:24:22.780
I feel like I'm being taken away.

00:24:24.280 --> 00:24:28.210
Somehow, it's a very big thing.

00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:29.690
But...

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:34.030
For example, dreams.

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:37.100
I also have a dream.

00:24:37.300 --> 00:24:38.980
Sayaka's dream?

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:41.300
I want to be a doctor.

00:24:42.320 --> 00:24:43.620
That's wonderful!

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:45.740
I think princesses are wonderful too.

00:24:46.240 --> 00:24:48.380
I don't know if I can become one yet.

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:53.640
I can do anything.

00:24:53.900 --> 00:24:55.320
I can become anything.

00:24:55.460 --> 00:24:56.960
I'm a friend's recipient.

00:24:57.460 --> 00:24:57.920
Friend?

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:02.010
I remember you too, Mirai-tachi!

00:25:02.010 --> 00:25:02.270
Yes!

00:25:02.710 --> 00:25:06.580
I'm sorry, I couldn't hear you.

00:25:07.580 --> 00:25:14.040
I still don't know what my dream is, but I will never forget you, Mirai-tachi!

00:25:14.100 --> 00:25:15.760
Mirai-tachi should be the same!

00:25:16.380 --> 00:25:19.380
My friends are definitely the same!

00:25:19.640 --> 00:25:22.410
Yes! I want to see you soon!

00:25:22.510 --> 00:25:23.050
To everyone!

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:28.510
There might be someone else who has been separated from us.

00:25:33.930 --> 00:25:34.910
Cue up! La-pa-pa!

00:25:34.950 --> 00:25:38.360
I hope everyone can meet their loved ones soon!

00:26:32.200 --> 00:26:32.860
What a coincidence.

00:26:33.440 --> 00:26:35.210
It's like a miracle or magic.

00:26:35.710 --> 00:26:40.500
I met Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu and Chiyu.

00:27:03.130 --> 00:27:03.510
What's wrong?

00:27:39.980 --> 00:27:41.360
What the hell did you do?

00:27:41.780 --> 00:27:43.320
That's why I didn't want to hold your hand.

00:28:01.140 --> 00:28:10.590
It seems that there is a difference.

00:28:11.190 --> 00:28:13.990
If you say that, we also have a difference.

00:28:14.330 --> 00:28:15.740
That's right.

00:28:16.140 --> 00:28:17.660
Do you stick together there?

00:28:17.860 --> 00:28:22.540
Well, I hope I can find another train.

00:28:23.500 --> 00:28:26.040
Be careful this time.

00:31:06.240 --> 00:31:06.540
Ow!

00:31:07.030 --> 00:31:10.000
The humans here are...

00:31:10.000 --> 00:31:10.820
Calm down.

00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:12.760
But it's strange.

00:31:13.320 --> 00:31:15.730
The Demon King is suffering from ARK.

00:31:16.110 --> 00:31:18.140
ARK is controlling monsters from that castle.

00:31:20.080 --> 00:31:21.140
Someone is going to defeat ARK.

00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:25.440
No matter how I ask anyone, they only say similar things.

00:31:26.280 --> 00:31:27.320
The store is empty.

00:31:28.470 --> 00:31:28.990
Geez!

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:35.300
I wonder if it's because of someone called ARK...

00:31:35.300 --> 00:31:39.750
Pocah... Pocah, Pocah, Pocah, Pocah...

00:31:39.750 --> 00:31:41.680
What? Say it clearly!

00:31:42.400 --> 00:31:44.180
I can only say Pocah...

00:31:44.180 --> 00:31:45.940
I'm hungry...

00:31:46.410 --> 00:31:49.790
We're finally here!

00:31:50.410 --> 00:31:52.190
You have one more breath until the castle!

00:31:52.350 --> 00:31:55.260
Take a good rest here and recharge your energy!

00:31:55.670 --> 00:31:56.110
Yui!

00:31:56.270 --> 00:31:56.590
Huh?

00:32:00.420 --> 00:32:00.620
I'm so glad I'm alive!

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:30.200
Thank you for watching!

00:33:00.250 --> 00:33:01.300
It's a castle!

00:33:01.540 --> 00:33:06.760
It's a promise!

00:33:07.040 --> 00:33:18.440
But...

00:33:18.440 --> 00:33:22.110
What is this hole?

00:33:22.370 --> 00:33:28.220
You've worked hard so far, Sora-chan!

00:33:28.280 --> 00:33:29.840
It hurts, Ageha-san!

00:33:30.280 --> 00:33:34.760
Sorry! But now we know that our friends are in this world!

00:33:35.740 --> 00:33:38.770
Run! We'll find them for sure, Run!

00:33:38.890 --> 00:33:39.270
Yeah!

00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:43.880
Why are you so excited about other people?

00:33:44.200 --> 00:33:51.280
I know. This world is probably...

00:33:52.870 --> 00:33:54.950
Everyone, let's go!

00:34:02.810 --> 00:34:05.330
I'm so glad! I'm so glad!

00:34:05.510 --> 00:34:08.120
You really have a lot of power.

00:34:08.560 --> 00:34:09.940
Puka...

00:34:09.940 --> 00:34:12.420
It seems that you were lucky to be saved.

00:34:13.120 --> 00:34:20.050
What kind of face are you making?

00:34:20.450 --> 00:34:21.480
Puka! Puka!

00:34:21.720 --> 00:34:28.270
Puka! Puka!

00:34:32.560 --> 00:34:36.890
I told you it's okay, didn't I?

00:34:38.190 --> 00:34:39.810
It's okay, Laby.

00:34:39.950 --> 00:34:48.660
I don't know what happened, but I was scared.

00:34:49.280 --> 00:34:57.220
It seems to be continuing to the castle.

00:35:00.190 --> 00:35:01.580
We're safe now, aren't we?

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:08.110
Let's get on the first ride and surprise Manatsu and the others!

00:35:08.210 --> 00:35:20.740
You're so honest.

00:35:20.920 --> 00:35:22.180
It's quick and fast, so we're saved!

00:35:30.160 --> 00:35:31.500
I just want to talk to ARK!

00:35:32.060 --> 00:35:34.200
I don't think that's what she's going to do.

00:35:36.330 --> 00:35:37.570
I can't help it!

00:35:37.930 --> 00:35:42.440
Let's go!

00:35:54.070 --> 00:35:54.290
Oh, no.

00:35:54.350 --> 00:35:55.510
Did I make a mistake?

00:35:56.090 --> 00:35:58.650
This is what happened after all.

00:36:30.732 --> 00:36:31.452
We got this!

00:37:00.250 --> 00:37:19.920
That's a relief.

00:37:31.020 --> 00:37:32.560
Eh? What kind of situation is this?

00:37:32.910 --> 00:37:34.190
What's with that huge thing?

00:38:05.240 --> 00:38:09.620
Well, even if it's good over there, we haven't solved anything yet.

00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:12.720
But we can't ask for anything with this.

00:38:12.800 --> 00:38:15.890
I was going to talk to you, but you just attacked me.

00:38:16.310 --> 00:38:17.910
What should I do?

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:30.690
Don't break it.

00:38:30.750 --> 00:38:37.110
But...

00:38:37.110 --> 00:38:41.620
I broke it.

00:38:41.900 --> 00:38:46.550
This is actually a monster I made to defeat.

00:38:47.050 --> 00:38:49.230
The same goes for this world.

00:38:49.270 --> 00:38:50.940
The lab I made.

00:38:51.840 --> 00:38:53.470
But...

00:38:53.470 --> 00:38:54.810
It's a waste.

00:38:55.750 --> 00:38:56.250
You!

00:38:57.700 --> 00:38:58.760
What are you talking about?

00:38:58.840 --> 00:38:59.420
Don't come near me!

00:39:13.980 --> 00:39:18.060
Chigoyama, I found the true meaning of our town.

00:39:19.310 --> 00:39:20.980
There were traces of the Goyakashi.

